# Objective 5 (AI): the compiler-only optimizer cannot shrink this (7 -> 7).
# A smarter rewrite can: OR-merge two rules, `a AND b` + `a AND NOT b` -> `a`,
# and READ + WRITE -> ACCESS. Expected with the LLM: 7 -> 5 IR rules, 7 -> 4 statements.
SUBJECT engineer, contractor, analyst
RESOURCE deploy_api SUPPORTS EXECUTE
RESOURCE config     SUPPORTS READ, WRITE
RESOURCE metrics    SUPPORTS READ

ALLOW engineer EXECUTE deploy_api WHEN on_call
ALLOW engineer EXECUTE deploy_api WHEN change_approved
ALLOW engineer READ config
ALLOW engineer WRITE config
ALLOW contractor READ metrics WHEN on_vpn AND badge_valid
ALLOW contractor READ metrics WHEN on_vpn AND NOT badge_valid
ALLOW analyst READ metrics
